        "accession_number": "0001357459-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial opportunity for any of our product candidates could be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are more effective, have fewer or less severe side effects, are more convenient, or are less expensive than any products that we may develop.",
        "start_character": 24787,
        "end_character": 25079
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001357459-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001357459-26-000004-ba837de1990e5d21",
        "accession_number": "0001357459-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Pursuant to the terms of the Giiant License Agreement, we obtained the rights to develop, manufacture, and commercialize all compounds from Giiant, existing now and in the future, and any product containing or delivering any licensed compound, in any formulation or dosage for all human and non-human therapeutic uses for any and all indications worldwide, including those technologies that are the basis of PALI-2108.",
        "start_character": 15519,
        "end_character": 15937
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001357459-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001357459-26-000004-ba837de1990e5d21",
        "accession_number": "0001357459-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Should any of our product candidates be approved for commercialization, we intend to develop a plan to commercialize them in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 19277,
        "end_character": 19410
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001357459-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001357459-26-000004-ba837de1990e5d21",
        "accession_number": "0001357459-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The Newsoara Licensed Products only include the drug asset LB1148, which we ceased developing in August of 2023.",
        "start_character": 17588,
        "end_character": 17700
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001357459-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001357459-26-000004-ba837de1990e5d21",
        "accession_number": "0001357459-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The key competitive factors affecting the success of any products that we develop, if approved, are likely to be their efficacy, safety, convenience, price, and the availability of reimbursement from government and other third-party payors.",
