        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These may include new price restrictions on products we sell to Medicare or other government purchasers, or other regulatory changes impacting reimbursement or competitive dynamics in multisource markets.",
