        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are aware of several companies with product candidates in development for the treatment of patients with IBD including, but not limited to, Merck’s MK-7240, Johnson & Johnson's JNJ-2113, Genentech's RO7790121, Teva’s TEV-48574, Morphic Therapeutic’s MORF-057, Ventyx’s VTX002, and several being developed by Spyre Therapeutics including SPY001, SPY002, SPY003, SPY120, SPY130 and SPY230.",
